      "locked": false,
      "text": "JSON mode is the old way: OpenAI makes you write the word \"JSON\" in the prompt, and it still won't stop \"item\" vs \"product\".",
      "originalText": "JSON mode is the old way: OpenAI makes you write the word \"JSON\" in the prompt, and it still won't stop \"item\" vs \"product\".",
