      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Last row stays \"maybe\" in every column: a schema fixes the SHAPE, not the TRUTH. \"Pune\" can still come back as \"Mumbai\". You still need evals (Day 04).",
